# Umicom Framework
# File: cmake/UmicomStrategyResearchPlatform.cmake
#
# PURPOSE:
#   Compose deterministic strategy coding, backtesting, replay, performance
#   analysis, optimisation, studies and simulation evidence over canonical
#   trading/chart/replay services.
